    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ background: '#1E293B', borderRadius: 10, padding: 18, marginTop: 28 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>结论：前后端分离 + MyBatis-Plus，开发效率高、结构清晰，是当前主流 JavaWeb 技术组合。</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 30, left: 60, right: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
